### Sales Orders API - E-Procurement Integration
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001/api
@bearerToken = inventory_integration_secret

### 1. Get All Sales Orders (by company)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-orders/list?company_id=12
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### 2. Get Sales Order Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-orders/detail?id=63&company_id=12
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
